# Data Mapping

## Objective

Map the source sales data to the appropriate Salesforce objects and fields before configuring and loading the CRM data.

## Source-to-Salesforce Mapping

| Source Data | Salesforce Object | Salesforce Field |
|---|---|---|
| Account Name | Account | Account Name |
| Contact Information | Contact | Contact fields |
| Opportunity Name | Opportunity | Opportunity Name |
| Opportunity Owner | Opportunity | Opportunity Owner |
| Account | Opportunity | Account Name |
| Stage | Opportunity | Stage |
| Amount | Opportunity | Amount |
| Probability | Opportunity | Probability |
| Close Date | Opportunity | Close Date |
| Product Name | Product | Product Name |
| Product | Opportunity Product | Product |
| Quantity | Opportunity Product | Quantity |
| Sales Price | Opportunity Product | Sales Price |
| Total Price | Opportunity Product | Total Price |

